p; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 사업개요</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;파견인원 : 100명</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;파견지역 : 27개국 35개 지역</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 중국, 아대양주, 중남미, 중동？아프리카, CIS, 일본, 구주, 북미 등</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;</span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">특정국가의 경우, 고졸, 다문화가정 지원자 우선 선발</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;</span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">지방대, 미취업 6개월이상 지원자 우선 선발</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"></u>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"